---
description: Dart/Flutter conventions for HackTracker
globs: app/lib/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

# Dart

- `const` constructors. No `print` in features; scoring/stats stay side-effect free.
- Riverpod: `ref.watch` in `build`, `ref.read` in callbacks. Dispose controllers.
- After `await`, check `mounted` / `context.mounted` before using `BuildContext`.
- Wire enums via existing `PaResult.wire` / `fromWire`. Do not invent parallel string maps.
- Generated Drift: edit `app_database.dart`, never hand-edit `app_database.g.dart`.
- Tests for any change to `ScoringEngine` or `StatsAggregator` (`app/test/features/...`).
- Analyzer must stay clean on files you touch. Do not skip `use_build_context_synchronously`.
